# Claude Code runtime / state file
# 
# .claude.json is primarily:
#   - Remote experiment flags (cachedGrowthBookFeatures, Statsig, etc.)
#   - Per-project usage history, costs, token counts, last sessions (tied to absolute local paths)
#   - Counters and "ever seen" state (tips, MCP connections, etc.)
#
# It is not a good candidate for dotfiles because it is very noisy and machine-specific.
#
# The actually useful cross-machine configuration lives in:
#   - .claude/settings.json   (model, enabledPlugins, permissions, voice, custom marketplaces, skips, theme, etc.)
#   - .claude/skills          (symlink → ~/.agents/skills)
#
# Custom prompts, skills, and reusable workflows should live in your skills directory
# or dedicated files rather than being buried in this runtime blob.
.claude.json
